        "example_json": "{\"id\":\"1\",\"type\":\"step\"}",
        "delivery": "Reviewed engine emits once per action; UI routes real events to renderer and sound. Snapshot normalizes legacy numeric event IDs to strings. Events never own quests or settlement.",
